! What This Page Is For

This page serves a few purposes:

# A list of commands that work in the Lojban parser for showing off to potential users.
# A list of commands that work in both parsers for regression testing.
# A list of Lojban commands that do or don't work relative to the English parser, for direction on what we need to work on in the future.

In addition, I'm compiling ((English mooix Test Script|English)) and ((Lojban mooix Test Script|Lojban)) test scripts, that can be run repeatedly and should clean up after themselves.

! Lojban Utterances That Work

Please make sure to add to the English section when you add something here.

* punji le blanu bolci le cnita be le melbi mudri jubme
* nitygau le blanu bolci le melbi mudri jubme
* le blanu bolci cu klama le cnita be le melbi mudri jubme
* le blanu bolci cu cnita le melbi mudri jubme
* le melbi mudri jubme cu gapru le blanu bolci
* ma cnita le melbi mudri jubme
* farlu fa le pastu
* se farlu le pastu
* sidju
* sidju fi "basics"
* klama le stici
* pluta
* \"language" po le lojbo cipra pilno cu binxo mooix:/var/lib/mooix/abstract/language/English
* binxo fa "name" po le test '<lang code="en">Lojban Test User</lang><lang code="jbo">lojbo cipra pilno</lang>'
* galfi "name" po le lojbo cipra pilno
* cmene fa '<lang code="en">Lojban Test User</lang><lang code="jbo">lojbo cipra pilno</lang>' le lojbo cipra pilno
* skicu le lojbo cipra pilno fo ".i mutce melbi"
* viska mi
* galfi "name" po mi
* ti zdani mi
* klama le zdani
* ponse ma
* lanli le pastu
* le pastu cu ckaji ma
* tcelanli le pastu
* sipna
* vreji
* ma fasnu
* finti "nukni bolci" fo le xunre bolci
* finti le nukni bolci fo le xunre bolci
* ma ve finti
* ma bangu
* bangu fa "gliban"

! Lojban Utterances That Don't Work, But Should

;gunta la norlaitru se pi'o le grana:other tags too
;co'u dasni le pastu:tense would need to distinguish commands
;vu'a klama:more tense issues; this one would be complicated, at best
;galfi zoi zoi name zoi po mi:zoi doesn't work yet
;ma vorme:pluta
;le pastu cu mo:show, showall, or look
;go'i:repeat last command
;go'i le grana:do it again, but to something else
;skicu le lojbo cipra pilno zo'e ".i mutce melbi":FA works, but zo'e doesn't work to skip a place
;ni'o:clear screen
;fa'o:exit the moo
;ma zvati ma:who
;le bi'u nukni bolci cu me le xunre bolci:derive a "nukni bolci" from the red ball
;le nukni bolci cu me le xunre bolci:reparent
;catlu le pastu .e le xunre bolci:logical sumti connectives
;klama le gapru .i klama le cnita:tries to resolve "le cnita" before going up
;co'o:for logging off
;viska le melbi mudri jubme goi ko'a:assignable pronouns
;bangu fa la gliban:Not sure what's needed here, exactly.
;stici:For going through the door named "west".  This is likely to be very hard.

! Lojban Utterances That Don't Work, And Shouldn't

;ca'e bolci ni'a le jubme:Very, very hard.
;setca le bolci le cnita be le jubme:not good use of setca
;le bolci cu se vasru le cnita be le melbi mudri jubme: bad use of vasru

